{
  "changelog": "Agent Team Kit v1.0.0 initial release\n\n- Introduces a full process kit for autonomous agent teams, enabling self-service work queues, clearly defined roles, and proactive operations through a heartbeat.\n- Provides templates for intake workflow, role definitions, backlog management, and status tracking.\n- Outlines a 5-phase intake loop (Discover, Triage, Ready, Execute, Feedback) with core and execution roles.\n- Includes heartbeat integration instructions to maintain continuous, self-sustaining operation.\n- Offers guidance on customization, anti-patterns, and optional team health metrics.",
